description	"K-2SO [Wookiee]

An exceptionally sturdy tank with protection against multiple Force powers and damage types. Deals massive knockback.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Flat KB: 150
-- -25% Rate of Fire
-- -15% Movement Speed
- Droid Spankers (Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Staggers/knocks down on hit
-- +165% Knockback
-- +5% Movement Speed
-- +100% Special Damage
-- -12% Damage
-- -35% Reach
-- +300% Radius
-- Slap ^3[GB]
- SE-14r Light Repeating Blaster (A280 2)
-- +10% FP Damage
-- Mag reload

^5Powers:
- Droid Rage (3) ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Armor Regen: 1/1.5s to 100
- +10% Knockback Given
- -50% Knockback Taken
- Fury (2)
- Strength (3)
- Beskar (3)
- Cortosis (1)
- Blast Armor
- Physical Resist
- Sense Immunity
- Anti-Mind Trick (2)
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Tracking Beacon"